OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after car and tractor
OL,4,Acollide
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager has been arrested after a
OL,7,Fman died when the car he was travelling
OL,8,Fin collided with a tractor trailer near
OL,9,FSelby.
OL,11,FThe crash happened on the A163 at
OL,12,FBarlby, near the junction with
OL,13,FWhitemoor Lane, at 19:30 BST on Monday,
OL,14,FNorth Yorkshire Police said.
OL,16,FA blue Range Rover SVR collided with
OL,17,Fthe rear of a trailer loaded with hay
OL,18,Fbales being towed by a Massey Ferguson
OL,19,Ftractor.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
