OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after car and tractor
OL,4,Acollide
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old man who was travelling in
OL,7,Fthe Range Rover was pronounced dead at
OL,8,Fthe scene, while a second 19-year-old
OL,9,Fman who was also in the Range Rover
OL,10,Fremains in hospital. A 17-year-old boy
OL,11,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of
OL,12,Fcausing death by dangerous driving and
OL,13,Fremains in police custody.
